{"id":"corrente","lemma":"corrente","pos":"noun","rank":1267,"glosses":["current (water, electricity)","airstream, draught/draft","trend"],"ipa":"/korˈrɛn.te/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"correnti"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-corrente.wav","examples":[{"text":"La corrente è molto forte.","en":"The current is very strong.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"very / a lot"},{"g":"strong"}]},{"text":"Perché non ero al corrente?","en":"Why wasn't I in the loop?","words":[{"g":"why / because"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Non abbiamo acqua corrente.","en":"We don't have running water.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"water"},null]},{"text":"Non c'è acqua corrente qui.","en":"There's no running water here.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"water"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Quando ritorna la corrente?","en":"When's the power going back on?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to return, to go back","l":"ritornare"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}